# Loaded by Vite in production builds only (`pnpm run build` in the Fly image); committed, unlike .env.local, because the image is built from git.
#
# The runtime data is fetched from the site's own origin. maderas, the server before
# Fly, built this way through its uncommitted .env.local; without this file the image would bake in
# src/manifest.ts's default, https://beeatlas.net/data, and a staging site would
# fetch production's data (beeatlas-cjyz).
VITE_DATA_BASE_URL=/data
